<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the Bangkok SET 50 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the Bangkok SET 50 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Bangkok SET 50 index, lead manager Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.APR.97-16.OCT.98   PAYDATE	24.APR.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  SET 50-52.68 THB  15.30786 PER 1.0 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE	ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	 55 THB	0.83 DEM  28.51 PCT  4.15 X</p>
<p> CALL	 60 THB	0.71 DEM  34.52 PCT  4.85 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
